    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A Vibrorapier is designed to have a longer, thinner blade than the standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroblade\" title=\"Vibroblade\">Vibroblade</a>. It is well-balanced and completely silent due to a specialized design that diminishes the ultrasonic pitch that other Vibro Weapons normally create. Many professional fighters consider the Vibrorapier an excellent weapon and prefer it over a blaster or other melee weapons when stealth is necessary. </p><p>A Vibrorapier requires&nbsp;two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Cells\">Energy Cells</a>&nbsp;to operate. </p>",
